# Markdown files use trailing double-spaces as an intentional hard line
# break (a standard Markdown convention), not accidental trailing
# whitespace. Excluded here so CI's `git diff --check` (see
# .github/workflows/ci.yml) doesn't flag it as a whitespace error —
# conflict-marker detection is a separate check and stays active for
# every file, markdown included.
*.md whitespace=-trailing-space,-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof
